<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Aussie Home to cut variable rate to 7.99 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Aussie Home to cut variable rate to 7.99 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mortgage originator Aussie Home Loans said on Friday it would cut its variable mortgage interest rate by 0.66 percentage points to 7.99 percent.</p>
<p>Aussie, which has taken market share from the banking sector in recent years, said its latest rate would be the lowest by any major lender in the past 20 years.</p>
<p>The new rate will take effect on December 10.</p>
</text>
